        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Denton, Albert Costa, Johan Kriek\n- Places: Kingsville, Texas\n- Organizations: ATP Tour\n- Events: 1982 Australian Open – Men's Singles\n- Topics: tennis careers, championships\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Denton was born on September 5, 1956, in Kingsville, Texas.\n- Albert Costa began playing tennis at the age of five.\n- Steve Denton is a former professional tennis player on the ATP Tour.\n- Johan Kriek was the defending champion at the 1982 Australian Open – Men's Singles.\n- Johan Kriek defeated Steve Denton 6–3, 6–3, 6–2 in the final to win the Men's Singles title at the 1982 Australian Open.\n- The 1982 Australian Open – Men's Singles final between Johan Kriek and Steve Denton was a rematch of the previous year's final.",
